# POLLY, see where you are and where an edit lands (docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-visibility-design.md): each
# editing screen stopped, playing, right after an edit and after undo. The cursor a thick coral ring or line (where the
# knobs and keys write), the playhead teal, never the same; what changed flashes coral FLASH_MS (500 ms); the place in
# words by the cursor. Pages: 0 Home, 1 Song, 4 Progression, 6 Band, 8 Sound.
# Keys: F3 0, G3 2, A3 4, B3 6, C4 7, D4 9, E4 11, G4 14. Pop at 120 BPM: a beat is 500 ms. Chords: root * 100 + CH_*.
wait 300
spin K2 15
expect tempo 120
# ---- a progression: P9, Am F C G, a chord a bar (step writing on Progression, stopped)
press HOME
tapkey w8
release HOME
expect app_loop 9
tap ARP
expect page 4
tap REC
key 4 down
key 7 down
key 11 down
wait 50
key 4 up
key 7 up
key 11 up
wait 50
key 0 down
key 4 down
key 7 down
wait 50
key 0 up
key 4 up
key 7 up
wait 50
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 50
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 50
key 2 down
key 6 down
key 9 down
wait 50
key 2 up
key 6 up
key 9 up
wait 50
tap REC
expect loop_bars9 4
expect loop_ch9_4 500
# ---- Progression, stopped: the cursor (bar 2 beat 3) ringed coral, its bar and beat numbers on coral, "bar 2 . beat 3"
turn K1 -2
turn K2 2
expect cbeat 6
wait 1100
expect flash_beats 0
shot prog_stopped.png
# an edit: ROOT at the cursor writes a chord there; it flashes
turn K3 2
expect loop_ch9_6 700
expect flash_beats 64
shot prog_edit.png
wait 1100
expect flash_beats 0
# undo with the cursor elsewhere: the cursor goes back to it (bar 2 beat 3), it flashes
turn K1 2
expect cbeat 14
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect loop_ch9_6 -1
expect cbeat 6
expect flash_beats 64
expect msgtext_is_UNDO_P9_CHORD 1
shot prog_undo.png
# playing: the playhead teal (the beat playing), the cursor still ringed
tap PLAY
wait 1300
expect playing 1
shot prog_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Band: the cursor (BAR, BEAT on KNOBs 2, 3) a coral line down the instruments, "bar 2 . beat 3" under it
tap SEQ
expect page 6
expect pcur 0
turn K2 1
turn K3 2
expect pcur 6
wait 600
shot band_stopped.png
# an edit: MUTE (KNOB 4) the selected instrument (C1): its row flashes
expect track 5
turn K4 1
expect trk5_mute 1
expect flash_rows 16
shot band_edit.png
wait 600
expect flash_rows 0
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect trk5_mute 0
expect flash_rows 16
expect msgtext_is_UNDO_MUTES 1
shot band_undo.png
# playing: the playhead a teal line, the cursor stays
tap PLAY
wait 1300
shot band_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# recording C1 (REC, PLAY: after a bar of count-in): a note recorded flashes its bar; undo flashes C1's row on Band
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 2300
expect recording 1
tapkey 7
wait 20
expect flash_bars >0
shot band_rec.png
wait 1000
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 1100
expect slot1_trk5_count 22
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect slot1_trk5_count 21
expect flash_rows 16
shot band_rec_undo.png
wait 600
# ---- Song: three sections of P9; the cursor ringed coral (thick), "section 2 of 3"
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect page 1
tapkey w8
tapkey w8
tapkey w8
expect rows 3
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 2
wait 1100
shot song_stopped.png
# an edit: REPEAT x2 on section 2; the section flashes
turn K4 1
expect row_rep2 2
expect flash_rows 2
shot song_edit.png
wait 1100
turn K1 1
expect cursor 3
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect row_rep2 1
expect cursor 2
expect flash_rows 2
shot song_undo.png
wait 600
# playing: the section playing filled teal, inside the cursor's ring while the cursor follows it; the cursor moved off it
tap PLAY
wait 4500
expect playing 1
expect sect 2
expect row 1
shot song_playing.png
turn K1 2
expect cursor 3
shot song_playing2.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Melodies: Sound with M1: the section's bars shown, stopped too; the cursor (the section's bar 1) ringed coral
turn K1 -2
expect cursor 1
tap EDIT
expect page 8
turn ALGO 4
expect lead_sel 1
wait 300
shot melody_stopped.png
# recording: section 1 from PLAY on Song, then REC here; a note recorded flashes its bar
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap EDIT
tap REC
wait 4000
expect recording 1
expect rec_wait 0
tapkey 7
wait 300
tapkey 11
expect lead_notes 2
expect flash_bars >0
shot melody_edit.png
wait 1000
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect lead_notes 2
shot melody_stopped2.png
# undo: the take's section flashes
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect lead_notes 0
expect flash_rows 1
shot melody_undo.png
press HOME
tap PLAY
release HOME
expect lead_notes 2
wait 600
# playing: the bar playing teal, the place teal ("section 1 . bar 2.1")
tap PLAY
wait 6200
expect sect 2
shot melody_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- Home: stopped, playing (the playing beat underlined teal), stepping with REC (the cursor ringed; from bar 2 beat
# 3, where Progression left it): a chord written flashes its bar, undo flashes it again and takes the cursor back
tap HOME
expect page 0
press HOME
tapkey w8
release HOME
expect mode 1
wait 300
shot home_stopped.png
tap PLAY
wait 1300
shot home_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap REC
expect rec_chords 1
key 9 down
key 13 down
key 16 down
wait 50
key 9 up
key 13 up
key 16 up
wait 20
expect flash_beats 64
shot home_edit.png
wait 1100
expect cbeat 8
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
expect cbeat 6
expect flash_beats 64
shot home_undo.png
tap REC
